{"id":"vod_md_5847","vodId":"5847","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"勇者死了！","name_cn":"勇者死了！","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231009-1/d876b83c52db6f0bae559c72aeeb1a31.jpg"},"summary":"三年前，勇者西昂利用圣剑之力打败了魔王，封印了地狱之门，但由于封印并不是非常的完整，导致时至今日，依然不断的有恶魔涌入人间，为非作乱。托卡（加藤涉 配音）是一名平凡的农夫，稍稍有些好色，对丝袜有着过分的执着。一次偶然中，勇者西昂意外的落入了他自制的陷阱中，一命呜呼。惊慌失措的托卡埋葬了勇者的尸体，哪知道第二天早上，托卡竟然变成了西昂的样子。原来，西昂的伙伴安莉（竹达彩奈 配音）是一名尸术师，她使用魔法将西昂的灵魂注入了托卡的体内。就这样，托卡需要代替被自己杀死的西昂，踏上再度封印地狱之门的旅途。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-09 08:27:22","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/GErwS8SL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/Wy4DHDKj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/YQIjNSr7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/4IvWXEKP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/Ohs5NcaD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/eFHkV3c9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/yIyYTc7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/HdXvc2rt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/yWP3wEyT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/866wjE2v/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/J5ObkaGt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231008/25UiSUEw/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:51.309Z"}